+//     every waiter wait on past its limit for EDEN_UP_WAIT_RECLAIM_EXTEND_MS (unset 3000) more; never past
+//     EDEN_UP_WAIT_RECLAIM_MAX_MS (unset 60000) from the wait's start. Bytes that only became slack inside
+//     allocator blocks, and trimmed heap pages, extend nothing.
+// Lines (stderr): EDEN_UP_WAIT_RECLAIM round ... (one per round, the first 200 and every 20th after),
