+    // to the pool in whole blocks (VMA's device memory returned to the driver, the swap's packed slots) of GRANT
+    // or more, or the pool's largest free piece grown to at least one block during the round. Allocator use
+    // that only became slack inside 8 MiB VMA blocks, or heap pages trimmed here and there, extend nothing.
